doctype html
html(lang="es")
    head
        meta(charset="UTF-8")
        meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
        meta(name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow")
        meta(name="theme-color" content="#123B73")
        title Verificación de correo | SaludVital
        link(rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css")


    body(class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 antialiased")
        //- Decorative background and main page layout.
        div(class="relative flex min-h-screen items-center justify-center overflow-hidden px-4 py-10 sm:px-6")
            div(class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-24 -top-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-[#13B8B0]/10 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true")
            div(class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-24 -right-24 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-[#168DE2]/10 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true")

            main(class="relative w-full max-w-lg")
                //- Brand header.
                div(class="mb-7 flex items-center justify-center gap-3")
                    div(class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#123B73] text-white shadow-lg shadow-[#123B73]/20" aria-hidden="true")
                        svg(class="h-7 w-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round")
                            path(d="M12 21s8-4 8-11V5l-8-3-8 3v5c0 7 8 11 8 11Z")
                            path(d="m9 12 2 2 4-4")
                    div(class="text-left")
                        p(class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#123B73]") SaludVital
                        p(class="text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-slate-500") Cuidamos de ti

                //- Verification result card.
                section(class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 bg-white shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/5")
                    div(class="h-1.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#123B73] via-[#168DE2] to-[#13B8B0]" aria-hidden="true")

                    div(class="px-6 py-9 text-center sm:px-10 sm:py-11")
                        if verified
                            //- Success state.
                            div(class="mx-auto mb-6 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#13B8B0]/10 ring-8 ring-[#13B8B0]/5" aria-hidden="true")
                                svg(class="h-10 w-10 text-[#13B8B0]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round")
                                    path(d="m5 12 4 4L19 6")

                            span(class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-[#13B8B0]/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0D827C]")
                                | Verificación completada

                            h1(class="mb-3 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#123B73] sm:text-3xl")
                                | ¡Tu correo está verificado!

                            p(class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-base")
                                | Tu dirección de correo electrónico ha sido confirmada correctamente. Tu cuenta está un paso más cerca de estar lista para que continúes.

                            a(href="/login" class="inline-flex min-h-12 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#123B73] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-[#123B73]/20 transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-[#0D2E5A] hover:shadow-xl focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#168DE2] sm:text-base")
                                | Ir al inicio de sesión
                                svg(class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true")
                                    path(d="M5 12h14")
                                    path(d="m12 5 7 7-7 7")

                        else
                            //- Error state.
                            div(class="mx-auto mb-6 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-50 ring-8 ring-amber-50/70" aria-hidden="true")
                                svg(class="h-10 w-10 text-amber-600" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round")
                                    circle(cx="12" cy="12" r="9")
                                    path(d="M12 8v4")
                                    path(d="M12 16h.01")

                            span(class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-amber-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-700")
                                | Verificación pendiente

                            h1(class="mb-3 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#123B73] sm:text-3xl")
                                | No pudimos verificar tu correo

                            p(class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-base")
                                | El enlace puede haber caducado, ser inválido o haber sido utilizado anteriormente. Puedes volver a intentarlo solicitando un nuevo enlace de verificación.

                            a(href="/login" class="inline-flex min-h-12 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-[#168DE2]/30 bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-[#123B73] transition duration-200 hover:border-[#168DE2] hover:bg-[#168DE2]/5 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#168DE2] sm:text-base")
                                svg(class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true")
                                    path(d="m15 18-6-6 6-6")
                                    path(d="M9 12h12")
                                | Volver al inicio de sesión

                    //- Card footer.
                    div(class="border-t border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/80 px-6 py-4 text-center")
                        p(class="text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500")
                            | ¿Necesitas ayuda? 
                            span(class="font-semibold text-[#123B73]") Contacta con nuestro equipo de soporte.

                //- Security and copyright information.
                footer(class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-center")
                    p(class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-500")
                        svg(class="h-4 w-4 text-[#13B8B0]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true")
                            rect(x="4" y="10" width="16" height="11" rx="2")
                            path(d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3")
                        | Tu información se trata de forma segura.
                    p(class="text-xs text-slate-400")
                        | © 2026 SaludVital. Todos los derechos reservados.